WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:05.075
Welcome to the Local Plant Supply partner portal.

1.2
00:00:05.533 --> 00:00:12.408
It's where you'll answer availability requests, look after your orders and chat with our team, all in one place.

1.3
00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:20.017
Your Local Plant Supply contact will send you a sign-in link, a username and a temporary password.

1.4
00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:22.642
Open the link and sign in.

1.5
00:00:25.167 --> 00:00:28.742
The first time, you'll be asked to choose your own password.

1.6
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:33.925
Type the temporary one, then a new one of at least ten characters, twice.

1.7
00:00:34.967 --> 00:00:37.767
Press Save and continue, and you're in.

1.8
00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:42.875
It works on your phone or your computer, so use whichever is handy.
